common='Use case: stylized-concept. Asset type: a single standalone fantasy trading card illustration for As Terras Despertas. Detailed ink drawing and warm watercolor/gouache on aged ivory parchment, elegant European illustrated bestiary, readable strong silhouette, expressive creature or object, copper expedition details, earthy pigments with the school accent. Centered subject fits fully in frame with breathing room, roughly square composition, painted edges fade into parchment. Rich fine detail and believable anatomy, hand-painted, not photorealistic, not 3D. No card frame, no letters, no numbers, no captions, no watermark. '
jobs=[dict(id=c['id'],name=c['name'],prompt=common+'Subject: '+c['scene']) for c in cards[12:]]
